Makes OPNsense appear in a UniFi Network controller as a UniFi gateway
(a UniFi Gateway Pro), so the controller shows the router's WAN and
LAN status, traffic, clients and topology next to your UniFi access points
and switches.

The daemon runs on the firewall itself and reads interface, client, DHCP,
DNS and system data directly from OPNsense; it needs no API key.

WWW: https://github.com/rtm516/unifi-gateway
